moji"&gt;📄&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;全文与离线支持&lt;/b&gt;：内置 Readability 全文提取并支持缓存加速；PWA 支持图文离线阅读与一键离线预加载；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🎨&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;高度个性化定制&lt;/b&gt;：支持完全自定义配色主题、字体字号与列宽，提供可嵌套的多层级标签（Labels）管理系统；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🛡&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;多用户与多服务器&lt;/b&gt;：支持角色权限管理、OIDC 单点登录（SSO）以及在多个 FreshRSS 实例间快速切换；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🐳&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;极简自建&lt;/b&gt;：提供单一 Docker 镜像（支持 amd64 / arm64 架构及树莓派），开箱即用。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🐙&lt;/span&gt; Repo:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Fripix/frirss" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/Fripix/frirss&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;📌&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1532?q=%23FreshRSS"&gt;#FreshRSS&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1532?q=%23Web%E5%89%8D%E7%AB%AF"&gt;#Web前端&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1532?q=%23%E8%87%AA%E6%89%98%E7%AE%A1"&gt;#自托管&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1532?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1532?q=%23%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7"&gt;#工具&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/DBD2LedsL28MiM6tKdA2l01B_diHncMPUwWsFCkEIA7tbAEdhFhz3VmFgWG9ZbtKaf4xse2cSBsXlQ7FvuFjhkTgrsApmuodoBwmo-FrqoN5nigFkJgkpSDGNqEImYFFTgwxyf4kKsY6EBgH8hgw4wTJ19VzB-dGP7GI89FMPsxDCig5tlsUGhn6txqMW2gMCG_wXN0rKmf9AQiNSQ6NF4-pfNET9jb6sbMWK2il5DmJseUT8UqMfEoXB1AlIzpcda-Vt0rOJo7KDM2xfkuRBNot4_oLxoiImR1_q_IWiaSeg0VlyeS3dZ2nn1SE65x0Lm4xPI6jdbFEWtiaGHwBYg.jpg" width="660" height="800" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1532</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1532</guid><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 06:00:51 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 RSStoKindle: 将 RSS 与 Substack 订阅排版推送至 Kindle</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;RSStoKindle: 将 RSS 与 Substack 订阅排版推送至 Kindle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢开发者提交&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pull/130" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt; PR #130&lt;/a&gt;，推荐了一款 RSS2KINDLE 在线服务——&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;RSStoKindle&lt;/b&gt;：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;核心特性包括：&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;📖&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;全文抽取与排版&lt;/b&gt;：支持任意 RSS 源及 Substack 订阅，抓取完整文章并自动排版为结构清晰、带章节目录的电子书；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;📬&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;自动定时推送&lt;/b&gt;：通过 Amazon Send-to-Kindle 邮箱机制投递，支持一键即时发送或设定每日早间 Digest 自动投递；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;💳&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;资费方案&lt;/b&gt;：免费版支持每日最多 5 篇文章投递；包含插图或更高频次需求可升级为 $60/年的付费计划。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔗&lt;/span&gt; 官网：&lt;a href="https://www.rsstokindle.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://www.rsstokindle.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;频道提及过的同类服务还有&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/88" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;WhereMyLife&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/13" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;KindleEar&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1056" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Reabble&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1291" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Ktool&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1473" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;SyncReads&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;等。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;📌&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1531?q=%23RSS2KINDLE"&gt;#RSS2KINDLE&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1531?q=%23Kindle"&gt;#Kindle&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1531?q=%23%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7"&gt;#工具&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/k1TwtVisYkgF0Ix9-YSemKrwE12QYCqiaEdHnmOOVcMY7s3QLhFCMgSdsFTh7B-cZqsdAC5-JQXX27hGYVql-oEkuDBS_iH_h3hk-G5fcEjPCYH63FArd3IaWq1uZq46bEF13Rj5Yx_fEatEQZ7Bcw_I23Xl2-a0AVVkK_DskrWvzDAmi6gdoAXu-E6RPNISPpdvfByVWIILTKy9oo--zWWsxvoXl6jOMRnRYD3r-zMcyS6iXdxCz-dWHp5bkxfUimoMdo1PO8VmxauQ-6d3QLg4XLQQCQfKQW0w5PsmwLQPys8vO6FpC9HlysJdlHYClFXWNiVn_PchMRZXdJtV5A.jpg" width="800" height="466" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1531</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1531</guid><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 06:00:34 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 eilmeldung: 基于 Rust 的终端 (TUI) 开源 RSS 阅读器</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;eilmeldung: 基于 Rust 的终端 (TUI) 开源 RSS 阅读器&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢开发者提交 &lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pull/127" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;PR #127&lt;/a&gt;，分享了一款极速轻量的终端 RSS 阅读器——&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;eilmeldung&lt;/b&gt;（德语“快讯”之意）：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;项目基于 Rust + Ratatui 构建，并依托 news-flash 核心库开发，具备以下特性：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⚡️&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;极速无阻塞&lt;/b&gt;：毫秒级秒开启动，操作非阻塞流畅；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;⌨️&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;(Neo)Vim 键位&lt;/b&gt;：支持全键盘 Vim 风格操作与快捷导航；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🧘&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;Zen 专注模式&lt;/b&gt;：可隐藏一切边栏干扰，专注于文章正文排版；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🔍&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;高级查询语言&lt;/b&gt;：内置强大的搜索与过滤语法，支持灵活条件过滤、分类与批量打标签；&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🖥&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;多平台支持&lt;/b&gt;：支持 Linux (AUR/Nix)、macOS (Homebrew)、Windows (Scoop) 及 NetBSD。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;🐙&lt;/span&gt; Repo:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://github.com/christo-auer/eilmeldung" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/christo-auer/eilmeldung&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;频道提及过的类似终端阅读器还有&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1461" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;syndicationd&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/788" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;neix&lt;/a&gt;、&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/386" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;Newsboat&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;等。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="emoji"&gt;📌&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1530?q=%23RSS%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%99%A8"&gt;#RSS阅读器&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1530?q=%23TUI"&gt;#TUI&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1530?q=%23Rust"&gt;#Rust&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1530?q=%23%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90"&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1530?q=%23%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7"&gt;#工具&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/RXm9x9gLpka1zctdaqxpAeqkRalOq9cieWPzak1yCQKoWAHp6oLwE4u4KOLJ0g4xSjv5M_eiRzzxZyg9noM_aWctMY5-weB2k3fRuOaklPR8WxrNxUxOh8WPypR2Zytk_w2zAsCnQrlVF2tPakrtysTTsPobMs3WPN9VfGdlA_Sbg9RXE0pE2QX0lcHi01sEAEu2Upd92Huy_cd6DB0EpAI6Imzn_E1TzP9jZ2p9urziKOwiBeLtWFmGJZwtnu1MxHtZdQB5GqtnpJ9TIKT-Fy3l5M4Nw6CwQ5-C6Xa29LW0D9bJacby4sh-wrHPBl43IQIcmlwAUszz1cIz7Qzvpw.jpg" width="800" height="588" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1530</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1530</guid><pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 06:01:14 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 RSStT Bot 项目招募继任者</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;RSStT Bot 项目招募继任者&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://t.me/aboutrss/1102" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;RSStT Bot 项目&lt;/a&gt;在 &lt;a href="https://github.com/Rongronggg9/RSS-to-Telegram-Bot" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;GitHub 上获星 2K+&lt;/a&gt;，&lt;a href="https://t.me/RSStT_Bot" target="_blank"&gt;@RSStT_Bot&lt;/a&gt; 是 Telegram 上有名的 RSS bot。官方 bot 和自架版我都有在用，一直体验很好。上月，项目开发者开始&lt;a href="https://t.me/RSStT_Channel/90" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;寻求继任者继续维护该开源项目&lt;/a&gt;。希望能有合适人选接力运维。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/U_6z82o5eIPxPzJ_gNfBkt1eMAyWNht2bvHoAF463AxprpyBWELy7gILQIAAEuUJGTlySRErO_vy7xWSKCwdlYd7l-7igEaot3BJAan6tOjMpGRvijIZH7o42x6wSCZBfrEMaDIVdQAzXboSRRBUNiBsZvGkH6sRpPDLR12HIuK1AXvgBK7z2Qnzk84Qo7tpR4spuN8cKY--Z8AG_CCV5a6bvknYCHRneu7R9oMHMHeax7UyTXUiqRQDgBjxXLyftg8-LPQ-uZ0OFlbgYaX0JnurQxmzFM852oGm6O4lYhiJPk9RKjw7a8JfoQiK6006d7vqJTcbVNbJxosHXMLRyA.jpg" width="733" height="800" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1529</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1529</guid><pubDate>Sat, 02 May 2026 01:18:43 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>🖼 Dashboard: 无后端需自架的多栏 RSS 订阅器</title><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dashboard: 无后端需自架的多栏 RSS 订阅器&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;感谢&lt;a href="https://github.com/AboutRSS/ALL-about-RSS/pull/126" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);"&gt;开发者提交 PR #126&lt;/a&gt;，分享了一个无需后端服务器的多栏 RSS 订阅器 Dashboard，纯本地信息存储或可部署于 GitHub Pages:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repository: &lt;a href="https://github.com/Rozhovetskyi/Dashboard/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://github.com/Rozhovetskyi/Dashboard/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Demo: &lt;a href="https://rozhovetskyi.github.io/Dashboard/demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://rozhovetskyi.github.io/Dashboard/demo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/UBFU3xbnrMDK_6KtIq9qfMXM6ghMlbLi8Fz5iHNKxZm57I1KuHWkA-O1VSHJyvte3xdvGba_00jtX_o0WtdFJonOrC2LtkgTODKZsFZynYGFNeIM46tJBC_xKXrAQBdT_TlhJENgicNRi-uwrEdHgCRI4oqhCVSXuSzj0KZO1g__utSqZt2xFVJ-NxNgsd8QY8HPEgZZmjfkOedlbWrN0fTWvXb1QzL9xk9wUwttk38T5nxaBT7nhg0TNLZzwIgr0hjT0nwar6JNjXJRt_Iqg9mIBtIbwLCp-ibk_fmYeb7SSdylc4xPE6HjfhQ36v5YxGMc-42H-Yo9OPGutA2EhA.jpg" width="800" height="514" referr